	["{npc:5885}, one of {zone:1454}'s mage trainers in {object:173161}, sends you to {npc:6546}; {npc:4568} in the {zone:1458} and {npc:3048} in {zone:1456} give the same quest."] = "{npc:5885}, einer der Magierlehrer von {zone:1454} in {object:173161}, schickt dich zu {npc:6546}; {npc:4568} in {zone:1458} und {npc:3048} in {zone:1456} geben dieselbe Quest.",

